COMPILATION OF: E46M4

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M4

   1 a 0000 E46M4:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] POOL DEDUP INSIDE ONE LIST:
   4 a 0006      `list('A','A','B','A')'. [C155] established one cell per
   5 a 0006      DISTINCT content program-wide and PL7/PL12 measured it INSIDE
   6 a 0006      one PUT LIST; this asks whether a file-route list behaves the
   7 a 0006      same way (four items, two pool bytes above the title) and
   8 a 0006      whether a repeated item repeats the SAME LXI H operand. */
   9 c 0006   dcl outf file;
  10 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M4OUT DAT');
  11 c 0023   put file(outf) list('A','A','B','A');
  12 c 005E   close file(outf);
  13 a 0064 end E46M4;

CODE SIZE = 0067
DATA AREA = 000B
FREE SYMS = 3887
END  COMPILATION
